{"id":3946,"title":{"romaji":"Lupin Zero","english":"Lupin ZERO","native":"ルパンゼロ"},"slug":"lupin_zero","synopsis":"How did this young boy become notorious gentleman thief \"Lupin III\"?\r\n\r\nLoosely based on Young Lupin III from the original manga, Lupin Zero will tell a nostalgic, yet brand new original story, finally lifting the veil cast upon Lupin III's humble beginnings. Set during the era in which the original series was first published, the anime depicts Young Lupin III running around the streets of 1960's Japan during the country's economic boom.\r\n\r\nA young boy climbs the staircase to villainhood. What was he thinking and what steps did he take? This is the untold origin story of the world's greatest thief.\r\n\r\n(Source: TMS Entertainment)","format":"ONA","season":"FALL","year":2022,"createdAt":"2022-12-17 19:03:15","updatedAt":"2022-12-17 19:03:15","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":53414},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":155925},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17679},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46654},{"site":"ANN","externalId":26491},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":22044},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":10449,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/Bt1tseFS0qlWtb2baOCkWDsei1H97BvkKKpvWkRT.png"},{"id":10450,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/kIfEjVknn6ddyzA1SXh8J4Zm5xJzBL9VUpdkUoyS.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":126,"name":"Telecom Animation Film","slug":"telecom_animation_film"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":100,"name":"Lupin III","slug":"lupin"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":11959,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":11954,"title":{"romaji":"AFRO\"LUPIN'68\"","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":13949,"version":1,"episodes":"1-6","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":16315,"basename":"LupinZero-OP1.webm","filename":"LupinZero-OP1","link